    {
      "bbox": [
        482,
        787,
        1212,
        838
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The Legislature has established the New York City Stabilization Reserve Corporation to enable the City to provide essential services during the City fiscal years 1973-1974 and 1974-1975; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2143,
          "min": -1.1259
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0037,
          "min": -0.1848
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7926,
        "area_px": 37752,
        "density": 0.20995,
        "chars": 199,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 25.11
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        482,
        839,
        1212,
        891
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Section 2548 of the New York City Stabilization Reserve Corporation Act (L. 1974, Ch. 571) provides that such Corporation may, with the consent of the City, use agents, employees and facilities of the City; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1857,
          "min": -0.9271
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 60,
          "mean": -0.0013,
          "min": -0.0462
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 8710,
        "area_px": 39204,
        "density": 0.22217,
        "chars": 219,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 25.14
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        482,
        891,
        1212,
        926
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is in the interest of the City to enable such Corporation to organize and operate as expeditiously and efficiently as possible;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1952,
          "min": -1.0459
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 28,
          "mean": -0.0073,
          "min": -0.1438
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5275,
        "area_px": 26136,
        "density": 0.20183,
        "chars": 139,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 26.35
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        481,
        925,
        1210,
        959
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, therefore, by the power vested in me as Mayor of The City of New York, it is hereby ordered as follows:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1946,
          "min": -1.0424
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0004
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 26,
          "mean": -0.0035,
          "min": -0.0893
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4194,
        "area_px": 25375,
        "density": 0.16528,
        "chars": 108,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 25.75
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        516,
        958,
        1210,
        1027
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. The New York City Stabilization Reserve Corporation is authorized to use the employees and facilities of the City, including those of the Office of the Mayor, the Bureau of the Budget and the Corporation Counsel to carry on its corporate purposes.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1744,
          "min": -1.0211
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
